{"title":"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <i>range</i> of a list of numbers is the difference between the largest number and the smallest number in the list. For example, the range of the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7f8bc14cdd0631cafcfbbc1b5eff7c66c6b959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 5, 1, 6, 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74dbf5a4d426fb8bb63d88ab4f21b351d2ee670c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 - 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_C\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part C\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part C</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_D\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part D\">2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part D</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC\" title=\"2018 CIMC\">2018 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2018 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=e